[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_02_0010","text":"（雾子状态怎么样呢\n　之前还在苦战来着……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_02_0020","text":"……………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_02_0022","text":"训练师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_02_0030","text":"很好哦雾子！\n进步好大，简直焕然一新了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_02_0040","text":"非常感谢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_02_0050","text":"雾子，跳得非常棒！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_02_0060","text":"哇……\n呵呵……太好了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_02_0070","text":"这都是雾子努力的成果啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_02_0080","text":"不…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_02_0090","text":"那是因为……一定……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_02_0100","text":"因为有……愿意守护我的人……\n在……"}]
